                <pb facs="0363" n="265" xml:id="pg265"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Goodnow to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-08-08"><hi rendition="#italic">August 8,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Japanese couriers, 1st August, report: “Attack on legations recommenced.” Fowler
                    wires advance from Tientsin began 5th. Sheng says viceroys expecting edict
                    degrading them—ordering them commit suicide. Thinks they would obey if from
                    Empress. Tsungli Yamen informs me will transmit peaceful messages. Answered
                    protesting, demanding free communication.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Goodnow.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
